- 1.0.0-beta.6
  Focus taken inside a popup scrolls only the scroll views inside the popup.
- 1.0.0-beta.5
  A token box: editable words with tokens among them, each a pressable pill the caret steps over and Backspace
  removes whole, put in by code, marked where wrong, and wrapping where the box is narrow.
- 1.0.0-beta.4
  Only the top card of a deck is loaded, and turning to a card loads what is on it. A popup hanging from an element
  on a covered card closes.
- 1.0.0-beta.3
  A coach mark: a bubble of text hanging from an element with its tail aimed at it, dismissed by a press on it or,
  where asked, anywhere else. The world stays dimmed under a popup as the window beneath it asked.
- 1.0.0-beta.2
  A scroll view scrolls sideways or both ways, with a bar along its foot, and brings an element into view either way.
  The wheel turns as a Vector2, Shift and the wheel turning it sideways: OnWheel, InputRoot.Wheel, Workspace.Wheel and
  WheelEventArgs.Amount take a Vector2 now. A text area takes a sideways turn too.
- 1.0.0-beta.1
  First release, a beta: the API can still change between versions.
